Externals / deviations:
- CloudFront asset host ddwl4m2hdecbv.cloudfront.net (b/<buildid> JS chunks + images) VENDORED locally under b/ and arc/ (the crawler rewrites the CF base to local; the /b/4O7Z0HED5ZNX/4O7Z0HED5ZNX.js.gz chunk is the real 9984 B gzip from crawl time — live CF now 403s the path for non-browser clients, so the vendored bytes are the last verified-good copy).
